DexSwapModule_AvalancheFork
├── router wiring
│   ├── it should store SwapRouter02 as the immutable router
│   ├── it should confirm the router reports the Avalanche Uniswap V3 factory
│   ├── given the Ethereum SwapRouter address
│   │   ├── it should have no code on Avalanche
│   │   └── it should revert with DexSwapModule_RouterNotContract
│   └── given an expired deadline
│       └── it should revert the router multicall with "Transaction too old"
├── swap WAVAX → USDC
│   ├── given PaymentRails configured for WAVAX → USDC via executeAction
│   │   ├── it should succeed against the real SwapRouter02
│   │   ├── it should decrease PaymentRails WAVAX by sell amount
│   │   ├── it should receive USDC at or above the oracle floor
│   │   └── it should leave module with zero balances and zero allowances
│   ├── given a direct module call from PaymentRails
│   │   ├── it should return success with USDC as outputToken
│   │   └── it should report a non-zero amountOut
│   └── given a larger size (50 WAVAX)
│       ├── it should succeed
│       └── it should receive USDC at or above the oracle floor
├── swap USDC → WAVAX
│   └── given PaymentRails configured for USDC → WAVAX via executeAction
│       ├── it should succeed
│       ├── it should decrease PaymentRails USDC by sell amount
│       └── it should receive WAVAX at or above the oracle floor
└── oracle enforcement
    ├── given zero slippage tolerance
    │   ├── it should fail gracefully instead of settling below the floor
    │   └── it should return the sell token to PaymentRails
    ├── it should estimate output within a plausible live price band
    └── it should validate successfully with Avalanche feeds
